WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.657
AI supply chain risk extends traditional software supply chain risk into models, datasets, embeddings, retrieval systems, tools, plugins, prompts, APIs, cloud services, dependencies, and build pipelines.

2
00:00:14.657 --> 00:00:23.856
Teams should understand where components come from, who maintains them, how they are updated, what permissions they have, and how behavior is monitored.

3
00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:35.570
Effective risk reduction depends on inventory, provenance, data quality, least privilege, dependency management, governance, monitoring, and continuous improvement.

4
00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:39.122
Useful outputs are only one part of safety and security.

5
00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:43.433
Responsible AI engineering requires visibility across the whole system.
